/* AVIS.ARTIFACT
   FILE: avis_cmt_artifacts.def
   NAME: AVIS_CMT_ARTIFACTS_DEF
   ROLE: Definition index for all AVIS .artifact template files

   PURPOSE:
       - Declares the full set of AVIS template artifacts (.artifact)
       - Establishes the structure and purpose of each template
       - Provides a registry reference for template-based generation
       - Distinguishes template artifacts (.artifact) from identity artifacts (.art)

   TEMPLATE_ARTIFACTS:
       AVIS.ARTIFACT_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.SUBSYSTEM_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.MODULE_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.EXPORT_TABLE_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.DEPENDENCY_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.LAW_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.REGISTRY_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.DESCRIPTION_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.IDENTITY_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.HISTORY_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.FUTURE_TEMPLATE.artifact
       AVIS.COMMENT_BLOCK_TEMPLATE.artifact

   NOTES:
       - This file does not define identity; it defines structure.
       - All .artifact files are templates, not registered AVIS objects.
       - All .art files are identity artifacts and must follow these templates.
*/
